      <p begin="00:28:52:00" end="00:28:55:00" region="bottom">So you have, and do look at the full</p>
      <p begin="00:28:55:00" end="00:28:58:00" region="bottom"> implementation, a full example in the video that he presents.</p>
      <p begin="00:28:59:00" end="00:29:02:00" region="bottom">You know, it's honestly mind-blowing, is building these</p>
      <p begin="00:29:02:00" end="00:29:06:00" region="bottom"> classes on the go, but just declaring the</p>
