      <p begin="00:29:09:00" end="00:29:12:00" region="bottom"> little bit of a vector class, and then, you know,</p>
      <p begin="00:29:12:00" end="00:29:15:00" region="bottom"> it just goes declaration, then consteval scope,</p>
