      <p begin="00:38:56:00" end="00:38:58:00" region="bottom">I think we're out of time.</p>
      <p begin="00:38:58:00" end="00:39:02:00" region="bottom">I wanted to show you this post on Mastodon</p>
      <p begin="00:39:02:00" end="00:39:05:00" region="bottom"> where someone said, &quot;C/C++&quot; &lt;heeeyyyy&gt;</p>
      <p begin="00:39:05:00" end="00:39:08:00" region="bottom"> compilers are a tool to convert source</p>
      <p begin="00:39:08:00" end="00:39:10:00" region="bottom"> code into undefined behavior.&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:39:10:00" end="00:39:12:00" region="bottom">And there was another one:</p>
      <p begin="00:39:12:00" end="00:39:15:00" region="bottom">&quot;I'm a full stack developer in that my stack</p>
      <p begin="00:39:15:00" end="00:39:18:00" region="bottom"> is full, and if you try to push any more tasks on me</p>
      <p begin="00:39:18:00" end="00:39:21:24" region="bottom">I'm gonna overflow it and start corrupting my own memory.&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:39:22:00" end="00:39:23:01" region="bottom">Right. I think that's it for today.</p>
      <p begin="00:39:23:01" end="00:39:24:23" region="bottom">Thank you very much for joining.</p>
      <p begin="00:39:25:00" end="00:39:28:00" region="bottom">And I'll see you next time, hopefully soon.</p>
